msgid "本港居民，60歲或以上，無傳染病或滋擾性行為均可入住 (60歲以下人士，證實有服務需要，亦可申請)。"
msgstr ""
"Hong Kong residents aged 60 or above who have no infectious diseases or "
"disruptive behaviour may apply. Applicants under 60 may also apply if their "
"need for the service is established."

msgid ""
"本院竭力將平安，仁愛，關懷，喜樂帶進各院友生活和生命當中，讓長者心身靈得到健康。家人得安心，照顧院友起居及護理更是我們的本分，我們樂意實踐愛護關懷尊重的事奉，發揚敬老的美德，讓長者安享愉快的晚年。"
msgstr ""
"We strive to bring peace, love, care and joy to every resident’s life, "
"supporting their physical, emotional and spiritual well-being and giving "
"their families peace of mind. Caring for residents’ daily needs and "
"providing nursing care are central to our mission. We serve older people "
"with love, care and respect, helping them enjoy a happy later life."

